## 7. Hot Water Loop
**File:** `Systems/CentralEnergyPlant/Systems/HotWaterLoop/Models/v0.mo`

The Hot Water Loop is the central heat exchange system coupling server waste heat to the cooling tower loop. It has 4 pump trains and 4 heat exchanger trains, all stageable.

### 7.1 Nominal Operating Conditions

| Port | Temperature | Pressure | Flow Rate | Source Line |
